  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/09/IMG_3853.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Tambi&eacute;n se ha rendido homenaje a los jugadores y entrenador del primer equipo de balonmano que se fund&oacute; en el municipio, el Onda Ve-Ge, despu&eacute;s Electrodom&eacute;sticos Ramos.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/09/IMG_3861.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmXraVjwJzI\" target=\"_blank\">Tras unos minutos de calentamiento</a> se ha jugado un partido contra el Club Handbol Vila-real, de 1&ordf; Nacional. Otro de los patrocinadores es Druida Bar&amp;Drinks.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenclubbalonmanocastellonda/img_3688.jpg\" alt=\"img_3688\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenclubbalonmanocastellonda/img_3689.jpg\" alt=\"img_3689\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenclubbalonmanocastellonda/img_3690.jpg\" alt=\"img_3690\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenclubbalonmanocastellonda/img_3692.jpg\" alt=\"img_3692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenclubbalonmanocastellonda/img_3694.jpg\" alt=\"img_3694\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenclubbalonmanocastellonda/img_3695.jpg\" alt=\"img_3695\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenclubbalonmanocastellonda/img_3696.jpg\" alt=\"img_3696\" style=\"max-width:100%;heigh